---
description: Design System v3 — tokens, ds-* classes, v3 components, a11y, no emojis
globs: apps/web/**/*.{astro,css,tsx,jsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

Token source of truth is `apps/web/src/styles/tokens.css`; primitives in `ds.css`; components in `src/components/v3/`. Rulebook: `docs/ui-rules.md`. Taste / page grammar: `docs/taste.md`.

- Colors: `ground`, `surface`, `hairline(-strong)`, `text(-muted/-faint)`, `yellow` (the one accent), `accent-text` (kickers), `blue` (edge only), `panel*`. Use `rgb(var(--token) / <alpha>)` or `ds-*` classes.
- Font: Figtree only. Radius 4px buttons / 6px cards / 999px pills. No shadows.
- Buttons: `ds-btn ds-btn--yellow|--cream|--ink|--outline`. Links: `ds-link`. Pills: `ds-pill` + `aria-pressed`. Cards: `ds-card` (+`--link`). Panel: `ds-panel` (one per page). Hover = colour swap only.
- Dark is canonical. Check light mode contrast (WCAG AA) when you touch color/text.
- No emojis. No accent as a full section background. If it looks clickable, it is clickable.
- CTAs that should show up in analytics get `data-track="slug"` (optional `data-track-label`).
- `pnpm --filter web lint:ui` must pass. Do not raise the hex/inline-style baselines.
